        "ggtNltZnp-1_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:px;\">Ingredients proven by science</span></p>",
        "ggtNltZnp-1_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:px;\">How does it actually work?</span></p>",
        "ggtNltZnp-1_childItem_2": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:px;\">Shipping and returns</span></p>",
        "ggTGRLYfUk-_text": "<p>The core ingredient — Shilajit Extract with 75% fulvic acid - has been studied in multiple clinical trials.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In a 90-day study published in <i>Andrologia</i>, men taking Shilajit showed a<strong> 20% increase in testosterone levels</strong> compared to placebo. Another study showed a<strong> 61% increase in sperm count.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The supporting ingredients — Ashwagandha, Gokshura, Kaunch, and Ginseng — each have decades of traditional use backed by modern research for male <strong>sexual health, stress reduction, and blood flow support.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This isn't guesswork. It's science.</p>",
        "ggqqrrV2_UL_text": "<p>Simple. We fix the root cause — not just the symptoms.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After 40, the lining inside your blood vessels gets damaged. Doctors call it Endothelial Dysfunction. Blood can't flow properly. Erections suffer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Our formula works in 3 steps:</p><p><strong>1. Repair</strong> — Shilajit delivers 85+ minerals to rebuild the damaged vessel lining</p><p><strong>2. Open</strong> — Gokshura and Ginseng boost nitric oxide to widen blood vessels</p><p><strong>3. Protect</strong> — Ashwagandha lowers cortisol and stops stress-related damage</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When blood flows freely again, erections come back. It takes 4-6 weeks to feel the full effect — because real repair takes time.</p>",
        "ggYFm1DLsDv_text": "<p>We offer free shipping on all orders. Most orders ship within 24-48 hours and arrive within 5-7 business days.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If for any reason you are not over the moon with your purchase, you can request a refund within 90 days of delivery of your first order. We’ll refund you for the full cost of the product. For all subsequent shipments, you may reschedule or cancel at any time in Your Account.</p>"
