      "settings": {
        "checksum": "1e8a10ba0c0045a61402c4a31ce0d63ed96925ed109ff0de2e5876ef1523cdbe_1_1_0_0__1",
        "ggNHgl1DZiL_text": "FAQs",
        "ggY-RQ-tUPE_text": "<p>Got questions? We’ve got answer...</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_0": "<p>How is this different from other Shilajit supplements I see online?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_1": "<p>Why didn't testosterone boosters or blue pills work for me?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_2": "<p>How fast does it work?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_3": "<p>Is this safe? Any side effects?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_4": "<p>Is the packaging discreet?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_5": "<p>How do I use it?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_6": "<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_7": "<p>Where is this manufactured?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_8": "<p>Why isn't this in stores?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_9": "<p>Can I take this with other supplements?</p>",
        "ggj8_rZPt0H_childItem_10": "<p>Is this vegan/gluten-free?</p>",
        "ggVw25EbDGC_text": "<p>Most Shilajit products use low-quality resin with weak fulvic acid content — sometimes as low as 10-20%. They're poorly absorbed and underdosed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Our gummies use Shilajit with <strong>75% fulvic acid</strong> — the highest potency available. Plus, we've added 7 supporting ingredients that work together to repair blood vessels, boost Nitric Oxide, and restore erectile function. This isn't a single-ingredient supplement. It's a complete system targeting Endothelial Dysfunction from multiple angles.</p>",
        "ggrE7DjchI2_text": "<p>Because they don't fix the real problem.</p><p><br>Blue pills force blood flow for a few hours — but they don't repair the damaged vessel lining. When the pill wears off, you're back to nothing. Plus the headaches, flushing, and other side effects.</p><p><br>Testosterone boosters raise T levels — but if your blood vessels can't open properly, that extra testosterone has nowhere to go. It's like stepping on the gas with a clogged fuel line.</p><p><br>We fix the vessel lining first. When blood flows freely again, everything else works.</p>",
        "gg7FoPQirqK_text": "<p>Most men notice more energy within the first week. By weeks 2-3, blood flow improves and some men report stronger erections already. Morning wood typically returns around weeks 4-5. Full results — harder, longer-lasting erections — by weeks 6-8.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Real repair takes time. We recommend 90 days for complete restoration.</p>",
        "ggeQZZBnGcx_text": "<p>Our gummies contain 100% natural ingredients used safely in Ayurvedic medicine for thousands of years. No prescription needed. No harsh chemicals.</p><p><br>The most common experience is increased energy in the first few days. Serious side effects are extremely rare. However, if you have heart conditions, blood pressure issues, or take prescription medications, consult your doctor first.</p>",
        "ggH-89SKUaI_text": "<p>It's a wellness pouch. Looks like any other health supplement. Nothing awkward. Nothing to hide.</p>",
        "gg6zySRdDUc_text": "<p>Take 2 gummies daily. Any time of day — though mornings are ideal. With or without food. Just be consistent. Results build over time.</p>",
        "ggpR1ZUkJDL_text": "<p>If for any reason you are not over the moon with your purchase, you can request a refund within 90 days of delivery of your first order. We’ll refund you for the full cost of the product. For all subsequent shipments, you may reschedule or cancel at any time in Your Account.</p>",
        "gggtRmscAp5_text": "<p>Our gummies are manufactured in an FDA-registered, GMP-certified facility. Every batch undergoes third-party testing for purity, potency, and heavy metals. No contaminants. No fillers. Just clean, effective ingredients.</p>",
        "ggct68RYTQs_text": "<p>Two reasons: quality control and price.</p><p><br>We oversee every step — from sourcing high-potency Shilajit to final testing. Retail markup would at least double the cost. By selling direct, we maintain the highest quality while keeping it affordable for you.</p>",
        "ggbSZqaqI6A_text": "<p>Yes. Our formula works well with most supplements. However, if you're taking blood thinners, blood pressure medication, or other prescription drugs, check with your healthcare provider first.</p>",
        "ggY-_GpztYs_text": "<p>Yes. 100% vegan, gluten-free, and no artificial ingredients.</p>"
      }
