        "ggtoXQrV5GY_text": "<strong>3. Protect</strong>",
        "ggkrn3YL9yw_text": "<p><strong>Ashwagandha</strong> and <strong>4 supporting herbs</strong> lower cortisol, increase stamina, and stop future damage.</p>",
